# Excel Forms Ingestion Environment Variables

# Microsoft Forms Configuration
MS_CLIENT_ID=your-microsoft-client-id-here
MS_CLIENT_SECRET=your-microsoft-client-secret-here
MS_TENANT_ID=your-microsoft-tenant-id-here

# Optional: Default paths
# GOOGLE_CREDENTIALS_PATH=/path/to/google_credentials.json
# EXCEL_FILE_PATH=/path/to/default_excel_file.xlsx
